9fefbb73e529"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[Cell[TextData[{
   "The real Eigenvalues and selected values of the (real-valued) stationary \
Eigenstates are exported into a textfile in the format for Max/MSP coll-file \
objects with dim+1 lines. For each ",
   StyleBox["NotesEigenState",
    StripOnInput->False,
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
   " we choose 17 points x = k Pi/6 for k = -6, ..., 10 along the x-axis, \
representing the notes Gb, ...., A#. To each of these lists we prepend the \
corresponding eigenvalue. Thus, Each line of the collfile  starts with the \
index m and a comma, and is followed by the Eigenvalue of index m, the ",
   StyleBox["NotesEigenState",
    StripOnInput->False,
    FontSlant->"Italic"],
   " of index m and a semicolon."
  }], "Text",
   CellChangeTimes->{{3.992573034967477*^9, 3.9925730760105124`*^9}, {
     3.992573245746047*^9, 3.992573297969474*^9}, {3.992573375103759*^9, 
