  TextCell[
   Row[{"The real Eigenvalues and selected values of the (real-valued) \
stationary Eigenstates are exported into a textfile in the format for Max/MSP \
coll-file objects with dim+1 lines. For each ", 
     Style["NotesEigenState", FontSlant -> "Italic"], 
     " we choose 17 points x = k Pi/6 for k = -6, ..., 10 along the x-axis, \
representing the notes Gb, ...., A#. To each of these lists we prepend the \
corresponding eigenvalue. Thus, Each line of the collfile  starts with the \
index m and a comma, and is followed by the Eigenvalue of index m, the ", 
     Style["NotesEigenState", FontSlant -> "Italic"], 
